p","text":"Blockchain applications often need efficient access to transaction and contract data."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Event indexing"},{"text":"Blockchain APIs"},{"text":"Graph-based indexing concepts"},{"text":"Transaction monitoring"},{"text":"Log processing"},{"text":"On-chain analytics"},{"text":"Data pipelines"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Build dashboards showing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Wallet activity"},{"text":"Token transfers"},{"text":"Contract interactions"},{"text":"Transaction history"},{"text":"Protocol metrics"}]}]},{"heading":"IoT + Blockchain Integration","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Because the degree includes IoT, students can develop specialized blockchain applications for connected devices."},{"type":"p","text":"Potential applications:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Supply-chain tracking"},{"text":"Device identity"},{"text":"Sensor-data integrity"},{"text":"Industrial IoT"},{"text":"Smart energy systems"},{"text":"Connected vehicle systems"},{"text":"Asset tracking"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"flow","items":["IoT Sensor","Gateway","Data Validation","Blockchain","Immutable Record","Dashboard / Application"]},{"type":"p","text":"However, avoid putting large raw sensor datasets directly on-chain. Use appropriate off-chain storage and store hashes or proofs when suitable."}]},{"heading":"Distributed Systems","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Blockchain is fundamentally related to distributed computing."},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Distributed databases"},{"text":"Replication"},{"text":"Fault tolerance"},{"text":"Consensus"},{"text":"Network partitions"},{"text":"Byzantine failures"},{"text":"Peer-to-peer systems"},{"text":"Distributed state"},{"text":"Eventual consistency"},{"text":"This knowledge becomes particularly important for protocol engineering roles."}]}]},{"heading":"Cloud & DevOps","kind":"other","blocks":[{"ty