ble GitHub work are generally more valuable than collecting many certificates."}]}]},{"heading":"PG Options","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Relevant postgraduate pathways include:"},{"type":"p","text":"M.Tech / M.E."},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Computer Science"},{"text":"Cybersecurity"},{"text":"Information Security"},{"text":"Distributed Systems"},{"text":"Blockchain / emerging computing areas"},{"text":"IoT"},{"text":"Artificial Intelligence"}]},{"type":"p","text":"M.Sc."},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Computer Science"},{"text":"Cybersecurity"},{"text":"Data Science"},{"text":"Information Technology"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Research"},{"type":"p","text":"For advanced blockchain protocol, cryptography, distributed-systems, or security research:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Tech","M.Tech / M.S.","Research","Ph.D.","Blockchain / Distributed Systems Researcher"]}]},{"heading":"Career Specializations","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"After gaining experience, the developer can specialize in:"},{"type":"h","text":"Smart Contract Engineering"},{"type":"p","text":"Solidity, EVM, DeFi, contract architecture."},{"type":"h","text":"Blockchain Security"},{"type":"p","text":"Auditing, vulnerability research, formal verification."},{"type":"h","text":"Protocol Engineering"},{"type":"p","text":"Consensus, networking, cryptography, distributed systems."},{"type":"h","text":"Web3 Full Stack"},{"type":"flow","items":["React/TypeScript","blockchain","backend."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Blockchain Infrastructure"},{"type":"p","text":"Nodes, RPC, indexing, cloud infrastructure."},{"type":"h","text":"IoT + Blockchain"},{"type":"p","text":"Decentralized device and asset ecosystems."},{"type":"h","text":"Blockchain Data Engineering"},{"type":"p","text":"On-chain analytics, indexing and blockchain data pipelines."}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Blockchain Developer","Blockchain Engineer","S